file construction/ITINERARY.md the account recovered, the grade corrected to A/94, and the cold-open finding put to Keaton; 40,944 of 40,960
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the cairn, with both byte figures taken again on this tree and the re-measurement named
file construction/archive/20260907-001653_itinerary-landed-accounts.md the elder DIFFUSER account, folded whole, header re-measured
